  { src: "/img/gta-6/tree-effigy-3-closeup.webp", alt: "Close-up of the GTA 6 tree effigy wrapped in vines with red flowers", cap: "Up close: look for vines wound around the trunk and red flowers tucked into them. It's easy to miss at a distance because it blends into the trees." },
